      "target": "../sections/sec-front-matter.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "A REVISION OF THE PROOF OF THE KEPLER\nCONJECTURE\nTHOMAS C. HALES, JOHN HARRISON, SEAN MCLAUGHLIN, TOBIAS NIPKOW,\nSTEVEN OBUA, AND ROLAND ZUMKELLER\nAbstract. The Kepler conjecture asserts that no packing of congruent\nballs in three-dimensional Euclidean space has density greater than that\nof the face-centered cubic packing. The original proof, announced in\n1998 and published in 2006, is long and complex. The process of revision\nand review did not end with the publication of the proof. This article\nsummarizes the current status of a long-term initiative to reorganize\nthe original proof into a mo",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "not-summarised"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/arxiv-0902.0350v1/blocks/prose-sec-000",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "Introduction",
      "pageStart": 2,
      "pageEnd": 3,
      "target": "../sections/sec-000-introduction.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "In 2006, {\\it Discrete and Computational Geometry} devoted an issue to the\nproof of the Kepler conjecture on sphere packings, which asserts that no\npacking of congruent balls in three-dimensional Euclidean space can\nhave density greater than that of the face-centered cubic packing \\cite{Hales:2006:DCG}, \\cite{Hales:2006:DCG:3}, \\cite{Hales:2006:DCG:4}, \\cite{Hales:2006:DCG:6}, \\cite{Ferguson:2006:DCG:5}.\n\n\n\nThe proof is long and complex.  The editors' forward to that issue remarks\nthat ``the reviewing of these papers was a particularly enormous and daunting task.''\n``The main portion of the re",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "not-summarised"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/arxiv-0902.0350v1/blocks/prose-sec-001",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "Part 1. Formal Proof Initiative",
      "pageStart": 3,
      "pageEnd": 3,
      "target": "../sections/sec-001-part-1-formal-proof-initiative.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "Part 1. Formal Proof Initiative",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
